{"4350620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voxel Playground", "steam_appid": 4350620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxel Playground is a <strong>micro-voxel</strong> physics sandbox built for VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by our <strong>state-of-the-art</strong> micro-voxel engine, the world reacts, collapses, and explodes exactly as you’d expect—whether you’re building, driving, fighting, or just messing around. Creatures, structures, vehicles, weapons… even you are fully physics-driven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The game will be updated continuously, and its <strong>price will go up</strong> as its development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350620/extras/c5d476688a9c4fd8146bf36c01fdde7c.poster.avif?t=1782110975\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350620/extras/c5d476688a9c4fd8146bf36c01fdde7c.webm?t=1782110975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350620/extras/c5d476688a9c4fd8146bf36c01fdde7c.mp4?t=1782110975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft gear, build your base, and fight off relentless zombie waves with your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350620/extras/45fea97f63872c07e02ddc4466ea8799.poster.avif?t=1782110975\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350620/